      "id": "n_quota",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 897.6,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "Runs on Cloudflare's free plan, whose daily limits fail rather than bill. Quota Watch (GitHub Actions,\n00:30 UTC) checks the last 7 days' peak: it opens an issue at 30% of a limit and fails at 80%.",
