      "id": "n_sweep",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1135,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "Daily cron (src/expiry.ts): D1 lists active matches untouched for 14 days, oldest first, up to 1,000 a run\n(the rest wait for tomorrow). Each match's MatchDO decides: still idle -> deleted (sockets closed, storage\nwiped) and its D1 row removed; won or touched since -> kept, and its D1 row refreshed from the DO.",
      "originalText": "Daily cron (src/expiry.ts): D1 lists active matches untouched for 14 days, oldest first, up to 1,000 a run\n(the rest wait for tomorrow). Each match's MatchDO decides: still idle -> deleted (sockets closed, storage\nwiped) and its D1 row removed; won or touched since -> kept, and its D1 row refreshed from the DO.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
