      "y": 3930,
      "width": 457.6,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "No ANDROID_APP_FINGERPRINTS set: no assetlinks.json,\nso links open in the browser. Local dev uses\nfortytwo://match/<id>, which only opens the app.\nInvited friends also get a push and a Lobby card\n(POST /api/matches/:id/invites).",
